 - `shipments.create_shipment(customer_id, weight_kg, zone)`: book a shipment
 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.shipments_in_zone(zone)`: list shipments whose zone is `zone`; returns a list of `Shipment`, sorted by id ascending (empty list if none). Raises `E_BAD_ZONE` if `zone` is not a known zone. Read-only: emits no events; idempotent trivially (no state change).
 
